id:                     E550
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan|ld
phase:                  configuration|linking
error_signature:        libboost_program_options is required but not found|libsamplerate not found, but required|unable to find library -lfftw3|Target ".*" links to:.*but the target was not found

severity:               2
category:               conan,cmake,dependency,linking
match_keywords:         CMakeDeps,imported target,legacy variables,Boost_PROGRAM_OPTIONS_FOUND,FFTW3_LIBRARIES,LIBSAMPLERATE_FOUND,pkg_check_modules,target_link_libraries,Conan
title:                  Bridge Conan CMakeDeps imported targets for upstream legacy CMake variables

root_cause:             Upstream CMake written for module/pkg-config mode checks legacy Boost_* or LIBSAMPLERATE_* variables, or passes bare -l names; Conan CMakeDeps config mode exports imported targets and private libdirs but does not populate those variables, so configure or link fails.
affected_scope:         CMake consumers whose upstream CMake uses legacy Find-module variables or pkg-config names while dependencies come from Conan CMakeDeps/PkgConfigDeps.
verification_cmd:       cd /Users/metyierzhen/Desktop/build_in_harmonyos/.worktrees/wavetral && conan create archives/w/wavetral/g20210517 -pr:h=ohos-local -pr:b=default --build=missing

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           bridge-conan-cmake-legacy-variables
rec_description:        In generate(), set legacy cache variables to imported targets when upstream calls find_package; for pkg-config-only dependencies, set absolute library and include paths from dependency package folders.
rec_command:            rg -n "Boost_.*FOUND|FFTW3_LIBRARIES|LIBSAMPLERATE_FOUND|target_link_libraries" CMakeLists.txt
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      patch-upstream-cmake-targets
fallback_description:   Patch upstream CMake to use CONFIG find_package and imported targets directly, preserving upstream style.
fallback_command:       conan create <recipe> -pr:h=ohos-local -pr:b=default --build=missing
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          manual-source-patch

forbid_1_pattern:       target_link_libraries\([^)]*-l(fftw3|sndfile|samplerate)[^)]*\)
forbid_1_reason:        Bare -l names do not carry Conan private libdirs and rely on system search paths.
forbid_1_consequence:   Linker fails with unable to find library.

principles:
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             E278,E392
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

